<title>USA: Astra to build 660 MW thermal plant.</title>
<headline>Astra to build 660 MW thermal plant.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Astra CAPSA, an Argentine energy company, said on Thursday that it will build a combined cycle thermal power plant in Dock Sud in Greater Buenos Aires.</p>
<p>The company said it will have a capacity of up to 660 MW and that the move was part of its strategy to increase its presence in the Argentine electrical sector.</p>
</text>
